# 仅将运行代码和迁移送入构建上下文，禁止本地凭据与运行数据进入镜像。
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!requirements-dev.lock
!README.md
!alembic.ini
!alembic.datasets.ini
!app/
!app/**
!migrations/
!migrations/**
!config/
!config/*.example.json
!scripts/
!scripts/verify_services.py
**/__pycache__/
**/.runtime/
**/*.pyc
**/.env*
